<title>NORWAY: Norway's jobless rate rises to 3.4 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Norway's jobless rate rises to 3.4 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Labour directorate issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p> NORWEGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT     JUNE 1997   MAY 1997  JUNE 1996</p>
<p> Unemployment (in pct)	   3.4	  3.2	  4.3</p>
<p> Unemployed			 75,500     71,743     95,065</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED FIGURES</p>
<p> Unemployed			 75,536     78,068     94,012</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
